api_contract:
POST /v1/similarity_rerank
Request fields: {query: string, candidate_embeddings?: [float32], candidate_ids?: [string], top_k: int (default 10), cost_mode: string (latency|balanced|cost), return_embeddings: boolean, metadata_filter: object (opaque)}
Response: {results: [{id: string|null, score: float, rerank_score: float, snippet: string, provenance: string}], query_embedding?: [float32], model_version: string, processing_time_ms: int}
Compatibility: When candidate_embeddings omitted and candidate_ids provided, runtime will invoke configured customer retrieval adapter or use stored managed embeddings depending on tenant settings. API will return stable schema version header X-RI-API-Version.
